On available
    If player is karus
        Say "Again to another world? It's all conusing. They all look the same. Let's talk to Bros of [Order of the Sorcery] about it."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Again to another world? It's all conusing. They all look the same. Let's talk to Sais of [Order of the Sorcery] about it."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "In the underworld, there are many same worlds in different dimensions. Devils, as the owner of these dimensions, raise their army and power. And we, [Order of the Sorcery], take the responsibility of resisting their force."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Anyways, time to cross into another world. [21Devil] General Marax of 36 troops is another devil with many troops. With him are powerful [45Devil] Vine and [65Devil] Andrealphus. Please eliminate and seal their souls.\n\nWe must give Bros of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [21Devil] Marax, [45Devil] Vine, and [65Devil] Andrealphus."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "In the underworld, there are many same worlds in different dimensions. Devils, as the owner of these dimensions, raise their army and power. And we, [Order of the Sorcery], take the responsibility of resisting their force."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Anyways, time to cross into another world. [21Devil] General Marax of 36 troops is another devil with many troops. With him are powerful [45Devil] Vine and [65Devil] Andrealphus. Please eliminate and seal their souls.\n\nWe must give Sais of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [21Devil] Marax, [45Devil] Vine, and [65Devil] Andrealphus."

On in_progress
    Say "You haven't sealed yet? Then I will send you again to them."

On claimable
    Show quest "You have sealed them up for sure. With this, we can seal three more devils."

On completed
    If player is karus
        Say "This time you have to fight against [Devil 9] Paimon, King of Hell, who has two hundred legions of demons under his rule. He's a devil who regards honor and glory as very important, and he always leads the war with his strong legions. Bring the [Devil 9 Summoning Scroll] and summon him from the [Devil 9 Summoning Stone] at [Luferson Castle]. Then, destroy him so that we can seal his spirit."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "This time you have to fight against [Devil 9] Paimon, King of Hell, who has two hundred legions of demons under his rule. He's a devil who regards honor and glory as very important, and he always leads the war with his strong legions. Bring the [Devil 9 Summoning Scroll] and summon him from the [Devil 9 Summoning Stone] at [El Morad Castle]. Then, destroy him so that we can seal his spirit."
